  "document": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Riverbend Engagement — PBC Request & Client Master List"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "To: Client Contact (Riverbend)\nFrom: Colin Mackey, Staff Accountant\nDate: June 3, 2025\nRe: Information needed for the 2025 tax engagement"
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Prepared-by-Client (PBC) Request"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please provide the following items to support preparation of the Riverbend tax return. Items marked with an asterisk (*) are critical for the initial workpaper setup and should be submitted by June 20, 2025. All other items are requested by July 11, 2025."
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "* Prior-year tax return (2024) and all supporting schedules",
          "* Trial balance as of December 31, 2025, in Excel format",
          "* General ledger detail for all accounts (cash, revenue, expenses)",
          "* Bank statements for all accounts, January–December 2025",
          "* Fixed asset listing with acquisition dates, costs, and accumulated depreciation",
          "* Loan statements and interest paid (Form 1098, if any)",
          "* 1099s received (1099-MISC, 1099-NEC, 1099-INT, etc.)",
          "* Accounts receivable aging as of year-end",
          "* Accounts payable aging as of year-end",
          "* Inventory schedule (quantity, cost, valuation method)",
          "* Shareholder/member contribution and distribution schedules",
          "* Any correspondence from IRS or state authorities"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Client Master List Entry"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The following information will be entered into the firm's client master list for the Riverbend engagement."
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Field", "Value"],
        "rows": [
          ["Client Name", "Riverbend"],
          ["Client Legal Entity", "Riverbend LLC"],
          ["Entity Type", "Limited Liability Company (partnership tax classification)"],
          ["Tax ID (EIN)", "23-4567890"],
          ["Fiscal Year End", "December 31"],
          ["Engagement Type", "Form 1065 (Partnership Return)"],
          ["Engagement Team", "Colin Mackey (Staff); [Manager Name TBD]; [Partner Name TBD]"],
          ["Client Contact", "[Name], [Title] — [email] / [phone]"],
          ["Billing Address", "[Street], [City], [State] [ZIP]"],
          ["Service Address", "[Same as billing unless noted]"],
          ["Prior-Year Return Filed", "Yes — 2024 filed June 2025"],
          ["Open Notices", "None known"],
          ["Key Dates", "PBC due June 20 (critical items), July 11 (all items); Filing deadline September 15"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Once the critical PBC items arrive, I will set up the tax workpaper binder, reconcile the prior-year carryforward balances, and begin the trial balance tie-out. I will follow up with the client on June 23 if critical items are not received."
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "— Colin"
      }
    ]
  }
}
